      "writtenOn": "2026-05-05T18:08:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That is an alternative worth pursuing, yes, thanks for bringing it up. Backporting that patch is trivial (it\u0027s not in the 2.43 tree).\n\nWe need to use 2.43 because that is the latest release and we do just 1 glibc upgrade per year, so for 2.44 (or more precise 2.45) we\u0027d have to wait until next year. 😊\n\nI\u0027ll backport the patch and if it works I\u0027ll drop this CL.\n\nAgain, thanks for bringing this up.",
      "parentUuid": "aadede2d_2991e901",
      "revId": "31b09b04b5d600191eed25998f9c524bfc75f23c",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
